  "title": "Specify the vendor-neutral workflow IR that every acquired workflow is translated into",
  "question": "Implementation target: a typed intermediate representation able to express stages, roles, gates, tool policy, fan-out and barriers, loops with convergence rules, human checkpoints, retries, resume, stopping expressions and lineage - expressive enough to round-trip the 10 saved Claude Code workflows losslessly, and explicitly NOT a second execution runtime.",
  "catalog_anchor": "command-center/WORK-UNIT-CATALOG.json:94631",
